  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "Yoroi DRep votes ABSTAIN on Withdraw 3,120,000 ada for Republic Integration: Wallet, & Token Management.\n\nAs Yoroi prepares to retire its DRep towards the end of December 2026, our focus during this final transition period is an orderly wind-down of our governance role, deferring decisions on this treasury expenditure to continuing DReps and active delegators."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}